<title>UK: Morgan Guaranty sets 100 mln stg three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Morgan Guaranty sets 100 mln stg three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager J.P. Morgan Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MORGAN GUARANTY TRUST</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    14.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.8685  PAY DATE    14.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.676    SPREAD	+14 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.00 PCT GILT DUE 2000</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
